            <div xml:id="d1121">

                <pb facs="1147" n="1133" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg1133"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.00/1476: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Guatemala</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-25T00:00:00-06:00">June 25,
                            1944—midnight</date>.<lb/>[Received June 26—1:03 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>409. Renewed negotiations this afternoon by delegation referred to in my
                    telegrams of today attended by President and part of Cabinet resulted in
                    deadlock. I will accompany committee from Diplomatic Corps tomorrow morning to
                    inform the Minister for Foreign Affairs<anchor n="4" xml:id="d1121-f1"/> that we
                    consider our mission accomplished, expressing regret at lack of success and
                    lamenting shooting incident this evening during exercise of good offices by
                    Corps. We will also express hope on humanitarian grounds that practical
                    armistice may be instituted by withdrawal of troops from streets. While
                    situation is not quite hopeless, <hi rendition="#italic">intransigeant</hi>
                    attitude of Government and today’s ruthless policy measures are distinctly
                    discouraging developments. Corps will endeavor to keep door open for possible
                    renewal of negotiations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1121-f1" n="4" xml:id="d1121-f1-content">
                <p>Carlos Salazar.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
